mal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><br />Because of the centre of the larger cube lies at a corner of the eight smaller cubes of which it is made<br /><br />Therefore, <math><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msubsup>